  "referenceNumber": "RUS1040",
  "remarks": "\nROSNEFT AERO is a Russian company selling aviation fuel and other related services to Russian airports. ROSNEFT AERO is therefore carrying on business in a sector of strategic significance to the Government of Russia, the Russian transport sector, thereby obtaining a benefit from or supporting the Government of Russia.  ROSNEFT AERO is also a Government of Russia-affiliated entity in which the Government of Russia holds directly or indirectly a minority interest. As a result, ROSNEFT AERO is involved in obtaining a benefit from or supporting the Government of Russia.\n The trust services sanctions were imposed on 21/03/2023.",
